# Aeterna Save auto-sync

When you finish a task that modified this project:

1. Follow `.cursor/skills/yunban-h5-git-sync/SKILL.md`
2. Run `bash scripts/sync-to-github.sh "message"`
3. Push to `https://github.com/kacapti5-ai/Aeterna-Save.git` on `main`
4. Do this automatically — do not wait for the user to ask
5. Skip only if the user explicitly says not to commit/push
